zJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"PupRtvjjZJcLzIlkMw3hpA","review_id":"olQAKsEM8JTpxB23-sBt-A","date":"2021-08-03T22:28:45","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9370932579040527,"text_excerpt":"This place was recommended by a friend who is from NOLA. From my understanding, they've been around forever and recently moved to this upgraded building. Bonus that this is a black owned establishment. We were greeted nicely at the door and seated immediately. Our server was a super cute young lady and she was very nice. My husband and I ordered way too much fish. We should have spilt a meal or they should really offer like a jr platter with 2-3 pieces of fish. But the large portion definitely makes you feel like you got your money's worth so that's appreciated. The fish was fresh and seasoned mildly. I'm from OH and admittedly, our fish is heavily seasoned probably because it's typically..."},{"business_id":"PupRtvjjZJcLzIlkMw3hpA","review_id":"0jtTF7V39SLDyr04wNQy-A","date":"2018-07-23T17:29:28","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9359568357467651,"text_excerpt":"The catfish is great! The service isn't rushed, but the fish makes up for it. The fries and green salad are wonderful too. Thank you to Barrow's for reopening. Love it!"},{"business_id":"PupRtvjjZJcLzIlkMw3hpA","review_id":"7wF5X3DxfPXvkMVJWNfAkw","date":"2018-08-02T20:36:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9308233857154846,"text_excerpt":"Remember going here when I was little before Katrina and was excited to go to the reopening. My boyfriend and I went and were immediately welcomed by the most wonderful staff. They were all smiling and seemed happy to be there. We were seated quickly and served in a decent amount of time. The catfish was DELICIOUS. Super crispy outside, perfectly flaky inside. Simply put - best catfish I've eveeeeer had."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"PupRtvjjZJcLzIlkMw3hpA","photo_id":"lbpEXFs7EurJGn0oRyODJQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/lbpEXFs7EurJGn0oRyODJQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9276827573776245},{"business_id":"PupRtvjjZJcLzIlkMw3hpA","photo_id":"gDV-aHekAakBl9sTR2FQig","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/gDV-aHekAakBl9sTR2FQig.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9276827573776245}]},"notebook_case":null}
